From fbb625d5a164d841615ab6ed9af383fe82b1a562 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Andy1210 <andy1210@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 03:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 027/137] BRING-UP: ASoC: dt-bindings: qcom: Add the SM8350
 LPASS WSA/VA macros and sound card

SM8350 (lahaina) has the SM8250 LPASS codec macro layout and runs the
legacy APR audio firmware (AVS), so its WSA and VA macros take the SM8250
compatible as fallback, and its sound card is one of the sm8250 machine
driver family.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-va-macro.yaml         | 3 +++
 .../devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,lpass-wsa-macro.yaml        | 3 +++
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/qcom,sm8250.yaml       | 1 +
 3 files changed, 7 insertions(+)

